# Git LFS Recommendation Note:
# Existing processed datasets (*.npz, *.csv) and model weights (*.pth) are retained for reproducibility.
# If future raw video files (.mp4), extracted equirectangular video frames (.png/.jpg),
# or very large checkpoints exceeding 50-100 MB are added, track them using Git LFS:
# git lfs track "*.mp4"
# git lfs track "*.tar.gz"

